---Accessibility features of the living area.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibility
---@field mobilityAccessibleShowerException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityMobilityAccessibleShowerExceptionEnum|string Mobility-accessible shower exception.
---@field mobilityAccessibleBathtubException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityMobilityAccessibleBathtubExceptionEnum|string Mobility-accessible bathtub exception.
---@field hearingAccessibleUnit? boolean Hearing-accessible unit. A guestroom designed to accommodate the physical challenges of a guest with auditory issues.
---@field hearingAccessibleUnitException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityHearingAccessibleUnitExceptionEnum|string Hearing-accessible unit exception.
---@field adaCompliantUnitException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityAdaCompliantUnitExceptionEnum|string ADA compliant unit exception.
---@field mobilityAccessibleShower? boolean Mobility-accessible shower. A shower with an enlarged door or access point to accommodate a wheelchair or a waterproof seat for the physically challenged.
---@field mobilityAccessibleUnitException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityMobilityAccessibleUnitExceptionEnum|string Mobility-accessible unit exception.
---@field mobilityAccessibleToiletException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityMobilityAccessibleToiletExceptionEnum|string Mobility-accessible toilet exception.
---@field adaCompliantUnit? boolean ADA compliant unit. A guestroom designed to accommodate the physical challenges of a guest with mobility and/or auditory and/or visual issues, as determined by legislative policy. Usually features enlarged doorways, roll-in showers with seats, bathroom grab bars, and communication equipment for the hearing and sight challenged.
---@field hearingAccessibleDoorbellException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityHearingAccessibleDoorbellExceptionEnum|string Hearing-accessible doorbell exception.
---@field mobilityAccessibleToilet? boolean Mobility-accessible toilet. A toilet with a higher seat, grab bars, and/or a larger area around it to accommodate the physically challenged.
---@field mobilityAccessibleBathtub? boolean Mobility-accessible bathtub. A bathtub that accomodates the physically challenged with additional railings or hand grips, a transfer seat or lift, and/or a door to enable walking into the tub.
---@field hearingAccessibleFireAlarm? boolean Hearing-accessible fire alarm. A device that gives warning of a fire through flashing lights.
---@field hearingAccessibleFireAlarmException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaAccessibilityHearingAccessibleFireAlarmExceptionEnum|string Hearing-accessible fire alarm exception.
---@field hearingAccessibleDoorbell? boolean Hearing-accessible doorbell. A visual indicator(s) of a knock or ring at the door.
---@field mobilityAccessibleUnit? boolean Mobility-accessible unit. A guestroom designed to accommodate the physical challenges of a guest with mobility and/or auditory and/or visual issues. Usually features enlarged doorways, roll-in showers with seats, bathroom grab bars, and communication equipment for the hearing and sight challenged.

