---Information about eating features in the living area.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEating
---@field kettle? boolean Kettle. A covered container with a handle and a spout used for boiling water.
---@field toaster? boolean Toaster. A small, temperature controlled electric appliance with rectangular slots at the top that are lined with heated coils for the purpose of browning slices of bread products.
---@field indoorGrill? boolean Indoor grill. Metal grates built into an indoor cooktop on which food is cooked over an open flame or electric heat source.
---@field refrigerator? boolean Refrigerator. A large, climate-controlled electrical cabinet with vertical doors. Built for the purpose of chilling and storing perishable foods.
---@field kitchenAvailable? boolean Kitchen available. An area of the guestroom designated for the preparation and storage of food via the presence of a refrigerator, cook top, oven and sink, as well as cutlery, dishes and cookware. Usually includes small appliances such a coffee maker and a microwave. May or may not include an automatic dishwasher.
---@field microwaveException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingMicrowaveExceptionEnum|string Microwave exception.
---@field snackbar? boolean Snackbar. A small cabinet in the guestroom containing snacks. The items are most commonly available for a fee.
---@field stoveException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingStoveExceptionEnum|string Stove exception.
---@field sinkException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingSinkExceptionEnum|string Sink exception.
---@field ovenException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingOvenExceptionEnum|string Oven exception.
---@field oven? boolean Oven. A temperature controlled, heated metal cabinet powered by gas or electricity in which food is placed for the purpose of cooking or reheating.
---@field indoorGrillException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingIndoorGrillExceptionEnum|string Indoor grill exception.
---@field snackbarException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaEatingSnackbarExceptionEnum|string Snackbar exception.
