---Features in the living area.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeatures
---@field washer? boolean Washer. An electrical machine connected to a running water source designed to launder clothing.
---@field tvCasting? boolean TV casting. A television equipped with a device through which the video entertainment accessed on a personal computer, phone or tablet can be wirelessly delivered to and viewed on the guestroom's television.
---@field inunitWifiAvailable? boolean In-unit Wifi available. Guests can wirelessly connect to the Internet in the guestroom. Can be free or for a fee.
---@field bathtub? boolean Bathtub. A fixed plumbing feature set on the floor and consisting of a large container that accommodates the body of an adult for the purpose of seated bathing. Includes knobs or fixtures to control the temperature of the water, a faucet through which the water flows, and a drain that can be closed for filling and opened for draining.
---@field tv? boolean TV. A television is available in the guestroom.
---@field universalPowerAdapters? boolean Universal power adapters. A power supply for electronic devices which plugs into a wall for the purpose of converting AC to a single DC voltage. Also know as AC adapter or charger.
---@field airConditioningException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesAirConditioningExceptionEnum|string Air conditioning exception.
---@field fireplace? boolean Fireplace. A framed opening (aka hearth) at the base of a chimney in which logs or an electrical fire feature are burned to provide a relaxing ambiance or to heat the room. Often made of bricks or stone.
---@field bidetException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesBidetExceptionEnum|string Bidet exception.
---@field ironingEquipmentException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesIroningEquipmentExceptionEnum|string Ironing equipment exception.
---@field inunitWifiAvailableException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesInunitWifiAvailableExceptionEnum|string In-unit Wifi available exception.
---@field privateBathroomException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesPrivateBathroomExceptionEnum|string Private bathroom exception.
---@field toiletException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesToiletExceptionEnum|string Toilet exception.
---@field toilet? boolean Toilet. A fixed bathroom feature connected to a sewer or septic system and consisting of a water-flushed bowl with a seat, as well as a device that elicites the water-flushing action. Used for the process and disposal of human waste.
---@field shower? boolean Shower. A fixed plumbing fixture for standing bathing that features a tall spray spout or faucet through which water flows, a knob or knobs that control the water's temperature, and a drain in the floor.
---@field hairdryerException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesHairdryerExceptionEnum|string Hairdryer exception.
---@field heatingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesHeatingExceptionEnum|string Heating exception.
---@field ironingEquipment? boolean Ironing equipment. A device, usually with a flat metal base, that is heated to smooth, finish, or press clothes and a flat, padded, cloth-covered surface on which the clothes are worked.
---@field dryerException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesDryerExceptionEnum|string Dryer exception.
---@field electronicRoomKeyException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesElectronicRoomKeyExceptionEnum|string Electronic room key exception.
---@field inunitSafe? boolean In-unit safe. A strong fireproof cabinet with a programmable lock, used for the protected storage of valuables in a guestroom. Often built into a closet.
---@field washerException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesWasherExceptionEnum|string Washer exception.
---@field dryer? boolean Dryer. An electrical machine designed to dry clothing.
---@field hairdryer? boolean Hairdryer. A handheld electric appliance that blows temperature-controlled air for the purpose of drying wet hair. Can be mounted to a bathroom wall or a freestanding device stored in the guestroom's bathroom or closet.
---@field showerException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesShowerExceptionEnum|string Shower exception.
---@field payPerViewMovies? boolean Pay per view movies. Televisions with channels that offer films that can be viewed for a fee, and have an interface to allow the viewer to accept the terms and approve payment.
---@field tvCastingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesTvCastingExceptionEnum|string TV exception.
---@field universalPowerAdaptersException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesUniversalPowerAdaptersExceptionEnum|string Universal power adapters exception.
---@field tvStreamingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesTvStreamingExceptionEnum|string TV streaming exception.
---@field electronicRoomKey? boolean Electronic room key. A card coded by the check-in computer that is read by the lock on the hotel guestroom door to allow for entry.
---@field privateBathroom? boolean Private bathroom. A bathroom designated for the express use of the guests staying in a specific guestroom.
---@field tvException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesTvExceptionEnum|string TV exception.
---@field bidet? boolean Bidet. A plumbing fixture attached to a toilet or a low, fixed sink designed for the purpose of washing after toilet use.
---@field fireplaceException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesFireplaceExceptionEnum|string Fireplace exception.
---@field inunitSafeException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesInunitSafeExceptionEnum|string In-unit safe exception.
---@field tvStreaming? boolean TV streaming. Televisions that embed a range of web-based apps to allow for watching media from those apps.
---@field airConditioning? boolean Air conditioning. An electrical machine used to cool the temperature of the guestroom.
---@field bathtubException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesBathtubExceptionEnum|string Bathtub exception.
---@field payPerViewMoviesException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaFeaturesPayPerViewMoviesExceptionEnum|string Pay per view movies exception.
---@field heating? boolean Heating. An electrical machine used to warm the temperature of the guestroom.

