---Information about the layout of the living area.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayout
---@field loft? boolean Loft. A three-walled upper area accessed by stairs or a ladder that overlooks the lower area of a room.
---@field livingAreaSqMetersException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutLivingAreaSqMetersExceptionEnum|string Living area sq meters exception.
---@field stairs? boolean Stairs. There are steps leading from one level or story to another in the unit.
---@field balconyException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutBalconyExceptionEnum|string Balcony exception.
---@field patio? boolean Patio. A paved, outdoor area with seating attached to and accessed through a ground-floor guestroom for use by the occupants of the guestroom.
---@field nonSmokingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutNonSmokingExceptionEnum|string Non smoking exception.
---@field stairsException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutStairsExceptionEnum|string Stairs exception.
---@field balcony? boolean Balcony. An outdoor platform attached to a building and surrounded by a short wall, fence or other safety railing. The balcony is accessed through a door in a guestroom or suite and is for use by the guest staying in that room. May or may not include seating or outdoor furniture. Is not located on the ground floor. Also lanai.
---@field livingAreaSqMeters? number Living area sq meters. The measurement in meters of the area of a guestroom's living space.
---@field patioException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutPatioExceptionEnum|string Patio exception.
---@field nonSmoking? boolean Non smoking. A guestroom in which the smoking of cigarettes, cigars and pipes is prohibited.
---@field loftException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaLayoutLoftExceptionEnum|string Loft exception.

