---Information about sleeping features in the living area.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleeping
---@field memoryFoamPillows? boolean Memory foam pillows. The option for guests to obtain bed pillows that are stuffed with a man-made foam that responds to body heat by conforming to the body closely, and then recovers its shape when the pillow cools down.
---@field queenBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingQueenBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Queen beds count exception.
---@field hypoallergenicBeddingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingHypoallergenicBeddingExceptionEnum|string Hypoallergenic bedding exception.
---@field singleOrTwinBedsCount? number Single or twin count beds. The number of smaller beds measuring 38"W x 75"L (97cm x 191cm) that can accommodate one adult.
---@field bedsCount? number Beds count. The number of permanent beds present in a guestroom. Does not include rollaway beds, cribs or sofabeds.
---@field memoryFoamPillowsException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingMemoryFoamPillowsExceptionEnum|string Memory foam pillows exception.
---@field sofaBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingSofaBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Sofa beds count exception.
---@field sofaBedsCount? number Sofa beds count. The number of specially designed sofas that can be made to serve as a bed by lowering its hinged upholstered back to horizontal position or by pulling out a concealed mattress.
---@field bedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Beds count exception.
---@field otherBedsCount? number Other beds count. The number of beds that are not standard mattress and boxspring setups such as Japanese tatami mats, trundle beds, air mattresses and cots.
---@field kingBedsCount? number King beds count. The number of large beds measuring 76"W x 80"L (193cm x 102cm). Most often meant to accompany two people. Includes California king and super king.
---@field doubleBedsCount? number Double beds count. The number of medium beds measuring 53"W x 75"L (135cm x 191cm). Also known as full size bed.
---@field kingBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingKingBedsCountExceptionEnum|string King beds count exception.
---@field cribsCount? number Cribs count. The number of small beds for an infant or toddler that the guestroom can obtain. The bed is surrounded by a high railing to prevent the child from falling or climbing out of the bed
---@field bunkBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingBunkBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Bunk beds count exception.
---@field featherPillowsException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingFeatherPillowsExceptionEnum|string Feather pillows exception.
---@field queenBedsCount? number Queen beds count. The number of medium-large beds measuring 60"W x 80"L (152cm x 102cm).
---@field singleOrTwinBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingSingleOrTwinBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Single or twin beds count exception.
---@field featherPillows? boolean Feather pillows. The option for guests to obtain bed pillows that are stuffed with the feathers and down of ducks or geese.
---@field syntheticPillowsException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingSyntheticPillowsExceptionEnum|string Synthetic pillows exception.
---@field hypoallergenicBedding? boolean Hypoallergenic bedding. Bedding such as linens, pillows, mattress covers and/or mattresses that are made of materials known to be resistant to allergens such as mold, dust and dander.
---@field rollAwayBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingRollAwayBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Roll away beds count exception.
---@field cribsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingCribsCountExceptionEnum|string Cribs count exception.
---@field syntheticPillows? boolean Synthetic pillows. The option for guests to obtain bed pillows stuffed with polyester material crafted to reproduce the feel of a pillow stuffed with down and feathers.
---@field otherBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingOtherBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Other beds count exception.
---@field bunkBedsCount? number Bunk beds count. The number of furniture pieces in which one framed mattress is fixed directly above another by means of a physical frame. This allows one person(s) to sleep in the bottom bunk and one person(s) to sleep in the top bunk. Also known as double decker bed.
---@field rollAwayBedsCount? number Roll away beds count. The number of mattresses on wheeled frames that can be folded in half and rolled away for easy storage that the guestroom can obtain upon request.
---@field doubleBedsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LivingAreaSleepingDoubleBedsCountExceptionEnum|string Double beds count exception.

