---@field freeSelfParkingException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ParkingFreeSelfParkingExceptionEnum|string Free self parking exception.
---@field parkingAvailable? boolean Parking available. The hotel allows the cars of guests to be parked. Can be free or for a fee. Parking facility may be an outdoor lot or an indoor garage, but must be onsite. Nearby parking does not apply. Parking may be performed by the guest or by hotel staff.
---@field freeValetParking? boolean Free valet parking. Hotel staff member parks the cars of guests. Parking with this service is free.
---@field parkingAvailableException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ParkingParkingAvailableExceptionEnum|string Parking available exception.
---@field selfParkingAvailable? boolean Self parking available. Guests park their own cars. Parking facility may be an outdoor lot or an indoor garage, but must be onsite. Nearby parking does not apply. Can be free or for a fee.

