---Swimming pool or recreational water facilities available at the hotel.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.Pools
---@field indoorPoolsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsIndoorPoolsCountExceptionEnum|string Indoor pools count exception.
---@field wadingPool? boolean Wading pool. A shallow pool designed for small children to play in. Can be indoors or outdoors. Also known as kiddie pool.
---@field adultPoolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsAdultPoolExceptionEnum|string Adult pool exception.
---@field outdoorPool? boolean Outdoor pool. A pool located outside on the grounds of the hotel and available for guests to use for swimming, soaking or recreation. Use may or may not be restricted to adults and/or children.
---@field waterslideException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsWaterslideExceptionEnum|string Waterslide exception.
---@field wadingPoolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsWadingPoolExceptionEnum|string Wading pool exception.
---@field lifeguardException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsLifeguardExceptionEnum|string Lifeguard exception.
---@field adultPool? boolean Adult pool. A pool restricted for use by adults only. Can be indoors or outdoors.
---@field indoorPoolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsIndoorPoolExceptionEnum|string Indoor pool exception.
---@field waterPark? boolean Water park. An aquatic recreation area with a large pool or series of pools that has features such as a water slide or tube, wavepool, fountains, rope swings, and/or obstacle course. Can be indoors or outdoors. Also known as adventure pool.
---@field poolsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsPoolsCountExceptionEnum|string Pools count exception.
---@field poolsCount? number Pools count. The sum of all pools at the hotel.
---@field poolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsPoolExceptionEnum|string Pool exception.
---@field lazyRiverException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsLazyRiverExceptionEnum|string Lazy river exception.
---@field waterParkException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsWaterParkExceptionEnum|string Water park exception.
---@field waterslide? boolean Waterslide. A continuously wetted chute positioned by an indoor or outdoor pool which people slide down into the water.
---@field hotTub? boolean Hot tub. A man-made pool containing bubbling water maintained at a higher temperature and circulated by aerating jets for the purpose of soaking, relaxation and hydrotherapy. Can be indoors or outdoors. Not used for active swimming. Also known as Jacuzzi. Hot tub must be in a common area where all guests can access it. Does not apply to room-specific hot tubs that are only accessible to guest occupying that room.
---@field outdoorPoolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsOutdoorPoolExceptionEnum|string Outdoor pool exception.
---@field wavePoolException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsWavePoolExceptionEnum|string Wave pool exception.
---@field lifeguard? boolean Lifeguard. A trained member of the hotel staff stationed by the hotel's indoor or outdoor swimming area and responsible for the safety of swimming guests.
---@field outdoorPoolsCount? number Outdoor pools count. The sum of all outdoor pools at the hotel.
---@field indoorPool? boolean Indoor pool. A pool located inside the hotel and available for guests to use for swimming and/or soaking. Use may or may not be restricted to adults and/or children.
---@field indoorPoolsCount? number Indoor pools count. The sum of all indoor pools at the hotel.
---@field pool? boolean Pool. The presence of a pool, either indoors or outdoors, for guests to use for swimming and/or soaking. Use may or may not be restricted to adults and/or children.
---@field hotTubException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsHotTubExceptionEnum|string Hot tub exception.
---@field lazyRiver? boolean Lazy river. A man-made pool or several interconnected recreational pools built to mimic the shape and current of a winding river where guests float in the water on inflated rubber tubes. Can be indoors or outdoors.
---@field outdoorPoolsCountException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsOutdoorPoolsCountExceptionEnum|string Outdoor pools count exception.
---@field wavePool? boolean Wave pool. A large indoor or outdoor pool with a machine that produces water currents to mimic the ocean's crests.

---@alias gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.PoolsAdultPoolExceptionEnum "EXCEPTION_UNSPECIFIED"|"UNDER_CONSTRUCTION"|"DEPENDENT_ON_SEASON"|"DEPENDENT_ON_DAY_OF_WEEK"

