---Conveniences or help provided by the property to facilitate an easier, more comfortable stay.
---@class gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.Services
---@field socialHourException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesSocialHourExceptionEnum|string Social hour exception.
---@field elevatorException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesElevatorExceptionEnum|string Elevator exception.
---@field baggageStorage? boolean Baggage storage. A provision for guests to leave their bags at the hotel when they arrive for their stay before the official check-in time. May or may not apply for guests who wish to leave their bags after check-out and before departing the locale. Also known as bag dropoff.
---@field fullServiceLaundryException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesFullServiceLaundryExceptionEnum|string Full service laundry exception.
---@field languagesSpoken? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.LanguageSpokenList Languages spoken by at least one staff member.
---@field wakeUpCalls? boolean Wake up calls. By direction of the guest, a hotel staff member will phone the guest unit at the requested hour. Also known as morning call.
---@field currencyExchange? boolean Currency exchange. A staff member or automated machine tasked with the transaction of providing the native currency of the hotel's locale in exchange for the foreign currency provided by a guest.
---@field concierge? boolean Concierge. Hotel staff member(s) responsible for facilitating an easy, comfortable stay through making reservations for meals, sourcing theater tickets, arranging tours, finding a doctor, making recommendations, and answering questions.
---@field twentyFourHourFrontDeskException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesTwentyFourHourFrontDeskExceptionEnum|string 24hr front desk exception.
---@field socialHour? boolean Social hour. A reception with complimentary soft drinks, tea, coffee, wine and/or cocktails in the afternoon or evening. Can be hosted by hotel staff or guests may serve themselves. Also known as wine hour. The availability of coffee/tea in the lobby throughout the day does not constitute a social or wine hour.
---@field twentyFourHourFrontDesk? boolean 24hr front desk. Front desk is staffed 24 hours a day.
---@field conciergeException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesConciergeExceptionEnum|string Concierge exception.
---@field currencyExchangeException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesCurrencyExchangeExceptionEnum|string Currency exchange exception.
---@field elevator? boolean Elevator. A passenger elevator that transports guests from one story to another. Also known as lift.
---@field baggageStorageException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesBaggageStorageExceptionEnum|string Baggage storage exception.
---@field fullServiceLaundry? boolean Full service laundry. Laundry and dry cleaning facilitated and handled by the hotel on behalf of the guest. Does not include the provision for guests to do their own laundry in on-site machines.
---@field frontDeskException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesFrontDeskExceptionEnum|string Front desk exception.
---@field convenienceStoreException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesConvenienceStoreExceptionEnum|string Convenience store exception.
---@field frontDesk? boolean Front desk. A counter or desk in the lobby or the immediate interior of the hotel where a member of the staff greets guests and processes the information related to their stay (including check-in and check-out). May or may not be manned and open 24/7.
---@field selfServiceLaundry? boolean Self service laundry. On-site clothes washers and dryers accessible to guests for the purpose of washing and drying their own clothes. May or may not require payment to use the machines.
---@field giftShop? boolean Gift shop. An on-site store primarily selling souvenirs, mementos and other gift items. May or may not also sell sundries, magazines and newspapers, clothing, or snacks.
---@field giftShopException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesGiftShopExceptionEnum|string Gift shop exception.
---@field convenienceStore? boolean Convenience store. A shop at the hotel primarily selling snacks, drinks, non-prescription medicines, health and beauty aids, magazines and newspapers.
---@field wakeUpCallsException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesWakeUpCallsExceptionEnum|string Wake up calls exception.
---@field selfServiceLaundryException? gcp.mybusinesslodging_v1.ServicesSelfServiceLaundryExceptionEnum|string Self service laundry exception.

